utrition per serving</h2></header><dl><div><dt>Energy</dt><dd>720 kJ (about 170 kcal)</dd></div><div><dt>Saturated fat</dt><dd>5 g (25%)</dd></div><div><dt>Carbohydrates (sugars)</dt><dd>10 g</dd></div><div><dt>Protein</dt><dd>5 g</dd></div></dl></section><section class="lux-recipe-details"><div><dt>Reference region</dt><dd>Reference: Venetian-style sweet-savoury bite</dd></div><div><dt>Suggested oil</dt><dd>No added oil is required; a little mild olive oil can finish</dd></div><div><dt>Allergen note</dt><dd>Contains gluten, milk and fish; check bread and caviar labels</dd></div><div><dt>Substitutions</dt><dd>Brioche can be replaced with baguette; use a dairy-free spread only after checking compatibility</dd></div><div><dt>Related products</dt><dd><a class="lux-recipe-product-link" href="<?php echo esc_url(luxureat_static_url('en/product', '?category=caviar#product-catalogue')); ?>">Caviar catalogue (subject to live stock and label)</a></dd></div></section></article></main>
